 "content": "Alt ser bra ut p\u00e5 denne maskinen \u2013 \u00e9n ting mangler:\n\n**I orden \u2705**\n- Microsoft 365, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook, OneNote\n- OneDrive, Teams\n- AppsAnywhere, SketchUp\n\n---\n\n**M\u00e5 fikses \u26a0\ufe0f**\n- **Windows Update** \u2014 \u00e9n ventende oppdatering: Realtek nettverksdriver (6001.16.126.344)\n\nKlikk **\u00abInstaller / oppdater med Zork Helper\u00bb** p\u00e5 kortet over, s\u00e5 installeres driveroppdateringen automatisk. Maskinen kan trenge en omstart etterp\u00e5."}], "ts": 1788859574.7419443}
